ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-04-14T21:49:12Z","updated_at":"2026-04-17T20:46:38Z","closed_at":"2026-04-16T14:56:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev 90113707f\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev (90113707f) - Fedora Linux 43 (KDE Plasma Desktop Edition) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090 (nvidia; 580.126.18) - AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 62.33 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n[AreaLight3D](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108219) in Compatibility results in a shader compilation error when it affects a material using vertex shading:\n\n```\nERROR: SceneShaderGLES3: Vertex shader compilation failed:\n0(987) : error C1503: undefined variable \"area_light_count\"\n0(988) : error C1503: undefined variable \"light_process_area\"\n0(988) : error C1503: undefined variable \"area_light_indices\"\n\n   at: _display_error_with_code (drivers/gles3/shader_gles3.cpp:262)\nERROR: Method/function failed.\n   at: _compile_specialization (drivers/gles3/shader_gles3.cpp:356)\nWARNING: shader failed to compile, unable to bind shader.\n     at: _version_bind_shader (./drivers/gles3/shader_gles3.h:215)\n```\n\nThis does not occur in Forward+/Mobile, where the area light is skipped on the vertex-shaded material (as vertex shading does not support area lights).\n\ncc @CookieBadger \n\nCompatibility | Forward+\n-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b31e64ed-cd5b-467b-a8b6-ea2f2070c8ae\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6640488-7e7c-41eb-a1c3-9658e4e0ee78\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Use the Compatibility renderer.\n- Add a MeshInstance3D node with a PlaneMesh.\n- Add an AreaLight3D node lighting up the PlaneMesh.\n- Assign a material to the MeshInstance3D mode, and set **Shading** to **Per-Vertex** on the material.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test_area_light_vertex.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26728880/test_area_light_vertex.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118586/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":3},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118586/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}